{"game":"Zillion","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"continues","name":"continues","kind":"named_range","doc":"number of continues before game over\n\ngame over teleports you to your ship, keeping items and open doors","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":21,"default":3,"special":{"vanilla":3,"infinity":21}},{"key":"floppy_req","name":"floppies required","kind":"range","doc":"how many floppy disks are required ","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":8,"default":5},{"key":"gun_levels","name":"gun levels","kind":"choice","doc":"Zillion gun power for the nu